Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 16:50:18 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1412/1463] HERESY 1459: a take's four blocks as lists with
 drawings; a right-click takes a wave's point out
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 15.10.2026, his picture of a take's Download / Refiner / Files / Edit: «реструктурировать эти четыре блока и сделать более восприимчивым для глаза? Где возможно, SVG иконки»; «правой кнопкой мыши снятие точки с кривой». Each of the four blocks is a column of whole-width rows, every row a drawing then its name (file-down for WAV, FLAC and MP3; a spectrum's bars and spell-check in the Refiner; braces, music and repeat in Files; crop, scissors and gauge in Edit), every block's name with its own drawing in the accent (Make again too); seven Lucide shapes added to the page's set. The WAV and MP3 labels written by the page keep their drawings. A right-click on a wave's point takes it out as a double-click does (the first and the last stay); the hint says so in all eleven catalogs. Kitchen suite 819/0 (two new checks).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
